{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":494218,\"title\":\"The Husband's Secret\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Tshiu-Bi and her husband Siu-Gi have a seemingly perfect marriage but still have no children. When Tsiu-Bi's friend, Le-Hun, a single mother, is forced to work in a nightclub to raise her son, Tshiu-Bi tries her best to help her. However, unbeknownst to Tshiu-Bi, Le-Hun and SiuGi were once lovers. To avoid complications, Le-Hun decides to move away, only to run into Siu-Gi again in a nightclub. After a night together, Le-Hun becomes pregnant. When Tshiu-Bi learns this startling truth, she makes a surprising decision.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xXOyB2IN22fXiCj4WKeVgGNqe56.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1960,\"runtime\":102,\"genres\":[],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"TW\",\"name\":\"Taiwan\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Lin Tuan-Chiu\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2150703,\"name\":\"Lin Tuan-Chiu\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zrRTI9DX5zHa71CXXKQURow3lKd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1708988,\"name\":\"Chang Mei-Yao\",\"character\":\"Le-hun\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sPF0oHhiYr8in59X0JAQHCuHNfe.jpg\"},{\"id\":2572248,\"name\":\"Chang Pan-Yang\",\"character\":\"Siu-gi\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3064774,\"name\":\"Wu Li-fen\",\"character\":\"Tshiu-bi\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"igZD0KpK_ew\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"BUZpHHGIknU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9zcFOBf9mtQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}